description: Read architecture and spreadsheet contract before planning
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

Before planning or editing this repo (or a fork/template copy), read `ARCHITECTURE.md`.

It defines:

- Drive + Sheet → GitHub Action → static `site/` data flow
- Google Spreadsheet column schema and sharing rules
- `config.json` / env overrides
- What is generated vs source of truth
- Safe change recipes

Do not invent alternate sheet schemas or private Google API auth unless the user asks.
